$ akb agent use claude-code
Global default runs Claude Code — every agent that named no runtime runs it.
Runtimes
  Global default       Claude Code
    id global
    provider   subscription — Claude subscription
    apiKey     not set

The first row is Global default — what an agent naming no runtime runs, and the one row
that can be neither renamed nor deleted. `akb agent runtime add <name> <harness>` adds one.
`args` goes after the settings' flags and before the CLI's own, and a "command"
override never turns it off.

